# Model weights (~9 GB) and the Windows GPU programs (~2 GB) are too large for Git (GitHub's limit is 100 MB
# per file). Copy models/ and bin/ from Google_Hackathon_v1.zip into this folder; see README_FIRST.md.
# Root-anchored: a bare "models/" would also ignore backend/models/ (the app's Pydantic schemas).
/models/
/bin/
*.zip

